                  "body": "Thank you for reaching out about the duplicate charge on your account. I sincerely apologize for this billing error!\n\nHere's what I need to help resolve this quickly:\n\n**Could you please provide your invoice ID?** This will help me escalate your case immediately to our billing team.\n\n**What happens next:**\n- Once confirmed as a duplicate charge, you'll receive a full refund within 5 business days to your original payment method\n- I'll personally ensure this is prioritized for you\n\n**To prevent future billing issues, I'd also recommend:**\n- Setting up billing alerts in your account settings\n- Reviewing our annual billing option, which offers a discount and eliminates monthly charge complications\n- Downloading our mobile app (iOS/Android) where you can monitor charges in real-time and receive instant notifications for any billing activity\n\n**Going forward:**\nIf you're experiencing any other issues or if you'd like to discuss upgrading to one of our premium tiers (which include dedicated billing support and priority resolution), I'm here to help!\n\nPlease reply with your invoice ID and I'll get this resolved for you right away.\n\nBest regards"
